3) TABETE (Japan)

## Overview

Food that is still being checked but is ultimately thrown away.

## Target audience

-	Restaurants
-	Cafes
-	Supermarkets

## Business model

- System usage fee

## Strengths

-	Number of stores partnering with the app (over 3,000)
-	The app operates in 23 cities, offering users a wide range of choices.

## Weaknesses

-	It operates solely for the Japanese market
-	The timeframe for receiving the product is strictly defined.

## Opportunities for Plately

-	Ukrainian market
-	Flexible pickup options
-	Detailed product information
-	Social impact through food waste reduction

