4) Expirenza (Ukraine, Mono)

## Overview

Buy boxes from Kyiv's best spots at special prices and save the planet using the Expirenza app.

## Target audience

-	Restaurants
-	Cafes
-	Customers

## Business model
-	Commission per transaction

## Strengths

- Building on the existing QR code system for restaurants, has been added option to receive "mystery boxes"

## Weaknesses
-	Limited to the monobank ecosystem
-	Limited focus on food waste
-	Limited box customization

## Opportunities for Plately
-	Independent platform
-	Better food waste analytics
-	Flexible payment options
-	Detailed box information

