5) Foodsi (Poland)

## Overview

A food-saving marketplace that allows users to buy surplus food
from local businesses at discounts of up to 70%.

## Target audience

-	Restaurants
-	Bakeries
-	Cafes
-	Supermarkets
-	Flower shops
-	Cosmetics stores

## Business model

-	Free registration for businesses
-	Commission on each sold package
-	Commission depends on the package price

## Strengths

-	Large user base
-	Large number of business partners
-	Discounts of up to 70%
-	Wide range of product categories
-	Strong presence in the Polish market

## Weaknesses

-	Limited presence outside Poland
-	Package contents may be unpredictable
-	User experience depends heavily on individual partners

## Opportunities for Plately

-	Better localization for the Ukrainian market
-	More transparent package information
-	Flexible pricing model
-	Restaurant analytics
-	Better communication between restaurants and customers
