6) Karma - Save food with a tap (Swedish)

## Overview
Karma is an application for buying surplus food from restaurants, cafes and stores.

## Target audience
-	Restaurants
-	Cafes
-	Supermarkets
-	Grocery stores

## Business model
-	Commission per transaction
-	Business service fee

## Strengths
